{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27216","headline":"天门街西观荣王聘妃 · 梁铉","name":"天门街西观荣王聘妃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝子乘龙夜，三星照户前。\n两行宫火出，十里道铺筵。\n罗绮明中识，箫韶暗里传。\n灯攒九华扇，帐撒五铢钱。\n交颈文鸳合，和鸣彩凤连。\n欲知来日美，双拜紫微天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}